#
msgid ""
msgstr ""
"Project-Id-Version: DRTC Korean Patch\n"
"Language: ko\n"
"MIME-Version: 1.0\n"
"Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8\n"
"Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit\n"
"Plural-Forms: nplurals=1; plural=0;\n"

#: deathforth/events/sc/cyoa-screcruit3.df:28
msgctxt "deathforth/events/sc/cyoa-screcruit3.df"
msgid "Hobbling Traveller"
msgstr "절뚝거리는 나그네"

#: deathforth/events/sc/cyoa-screcruit3.df:31
msgctxt "deathforth/events/sc/cyoa-screcruit3.df"
msgid ""
" is driving down a quiet back road and sees a strange figure.\r\n"
"\tIt is hobbling around with no coordination. \r\n"
"\tThe figure is maybe intoxicated, or maybe wounded?"
msgstr ""
"은(는) 조용한 뒷길을 달리다 이상한 형체를 본다.\r\n"
"\t균형도 못 잡고 절뚝거리며 돌아다닌다. \r\n"
"\t취한 걸까, 다친 걸까?"

#: deathforth/events/sc/cyoa-screcruit3.df:34
msgctxt "deathforth/events/sc/cyoa-screcruit3.df"
msgid "Offer it a ride"
msgstr "태워 준다고 한다"

#: deathforth/events/sc/cyoa-screcruit3.df:35
msgctxt "deathforth/events/sc/cyoa-screcruit3.df"
msgid "Keep driving"
msgstr "계속 달린다"

#: deathforth/events/sc/cyoa-screcruit3.df:41
msgctxt "deathforth/events/sc/cyoa-screcruit3.df"
msgid "Boot someone to make room:"
msgstr "자리를 만들려면 누군가 빼야 한다:"

#: deathforth/events/sc/cyoa-screcruit3.df:45
msgctxt "deathforth/events/sc/cyoa-screcruit3.df"
msgid ""
" makes an expression that's a mix of relief and a smirk.\r\n"
"\t"
msgstr ""
"은(는) 안도와 비웃음이 섞인 표정을 짓는다.\r\n"
"\t"

#: deathforth/events/sc/cyoa-screcruit3.df:46
msgctxt "deathforth/events/sc/cyoa-screcruit3.df"
msgid "Great! You won't regret this! Here's that food."
msgstr "좋아! 후회 안 할 거야! 여기 그 식량."

#: deathforth/events/sc/cyoa-screcruit3.df:52
msgctxt "deathforth/events/sc/cyoa-screcruit3.df"
msgid ""
"I DIDN'T NEED YOU ANYWAY!\r\n"
"\t"
msgstr ""
"어차피 너희 따위 필요 없었어!\r\n"
"\t"

#: deathforth/events/sc/cyoa-screcruit3.df:53
msgctxt "deathforth/events/sc/cyoa-screcruit3.df"
msgid " continues to yell as "
msgstr "은(는) 계속 소리친다. 그사이 "

#: deathforth/events/sc/cyoa-screcruit3.df:53
msgctxt "deathforth/events/sc/cyoa-screcruit3.df"
msgid " leaves."
msgstr "은(는) 떠난다."

#: deathforth/events/sc/cyoa-screcruit3.df:58
msgctxt "deathforth/events/sc/cyoa-screcruit3.df"
msgid ""
"I am begging you! I know I'll die here without help! I'm useless, just take "
"pity on me and let me join your group! I'll do extra work! You can't just "
"leave me here! PLEASE!"
msgstr ""
"제발 부탁이야! 도움 없인 여기서 죽을 거야! 난 쓸모없지만, 불쌍히 여겨서 일행에 끼워 줘! 일 더 할게! 날 여기 두고 가면 안 돼!"
" 제발!"

#: deathforth/events/sc/cyoa-screcruit3.df:59
msgctxt "deathforth/events/sc/cyoa-screcruit3.df"
msgid "Ok! Whatever!"
msgstr "알았어! 알았다고!"

#: deathforth/events/sc/cyoa-screcruit3.df:60
msgctxt "deathforth/events/sc/cyoa-screcruit3.df"
msgid "Leave silently"
msgstr "말없이 떠난다"

#: deathforth/events/sc/cyoa-screcruit3.df:65
msgctxt "deathforth/events/sc/cyoa-screcruit3.df"
msgid "Oh, come on! Please? Pretty please?"
msgstr "아, 왜 그래! 응? 제발?"

#: deathforth/events/sc/cyoa-screcruit3.df:66
msgctxt "deathforth/events/sc/cyoa-screcruit3.df"
msgid "Ok, fine"
msgstr "그래, 좋아"

#: deathforth/events/sc/cyoa-screcruit3.df:67
msgctxt "deathforth/events/sc/cyoa-screcruit3.df"
msgid "No!"
msgstr "싫어!"

#: deathforth/events/sc/cyoa-screcruit3.df:72
#: deathforth/events/sc/cyoa-screcruit3.df:99
msgctxt "deathforth/events/sc/cyoa-screcruit3.df"
msgid "HEH HEH"
msgstr "헤헤"

#: deathforth/events/sc/cyoa-screcruit3.df:72
msgctxt "deathforth/events/sc/cyoa-screcruit3.df"
msgid ""
"\r\n"
"\tThanks a lot, Obama."
msgstr ""
"\r\n"
"\t고맙다, 오바마."

#: deathforth/events/sc/cyoa-screcruit3.df:81
msgctxt "deathforth/events/sc/cyoa-screcruit3.df"
msgid ""
" snorts.\r\n"
"\t\t"
msgstr ""
"은(는) 코웃음 친다.\r\n"
"\t\t"

#: deathforth/events/sc/cyoa-screcruit3.df:82
msgctxt "deathforth/events/sc/cyoa-screcruit3.df"
msgid ""
"Yeah, you better run.\r\n"
"\t\t"
msgstr ""
"그래, 도망가는 게 좋을 거다.\r\n"
"\t\t"

#: deathforth/events/sc/cyoa-screcruit3.df:83
msgctxt "deathforth/events/sc/cyoa-screcruit3.df"
msgid " chortles."
msgstr "은(는) 킬킬거린다."

#: deathforth/events/sc/cyoa-screcruit3.df:85
msgctxt "deathforth/events/sc/cyoa-screcruit3.df"
msgid "'s voice gets panicked all of a sudden. "
msgstr "의 목소리가 갑자기 다급해진다. "

#: deathforth/events/sc/cyoa-screcruit3.df:85
msgctxt "deathforth/events/sc/cyoa-screcruit3.df"
msgid "WAIT!"
msgstr "잠깐!"

#: deathforth/events/sc/cyoa-screcruit3.df:85
msgctxt "deathforth/events/sc/cyoa-screcruit3.df"
msgid ""
"\r\n"
"\tYou can't just leave me here! Come on, take me with you. I'll give you a bunch of food, make it worth your time. Do we have a deal?"
msgstr ""
"\r\n"
"\t날 여기 두고 가면 안 돼! 자, 같이 데려가. 식량 잔뜩 줄게, 손해 아닐 거야. 거래할래?"

#: deathforth/events/sc/cyoa-screcruit3.df:87
msgctxt "deathforth/events/sc/cyoa-screcruit3.df"
msgid "Yes"
msgstr "좋아"

#: deathforth/events/sc/cyoa-screcruit3.df:88
msgctxt "deathforth/events/sc/cyoa-screcruit3.df"
msgid "No"
msgstr "싫어"

#: deathforth/events/sc/cyoa-screcruit3.df:94
msgctxt "deathforth/events/sc/cyoa-screcruit3.df"
msgid ""
" makes an exaggerated PFFFFT sound.\r\n"
"\t\t"
msgstr ""
"은(는) 과장되게 '푸흐흐' 소리를 낸다.\r\n"
"\t\t"

#: deathforth/events/sc/cyoa-screcruit3.df:95
msgctxt "deathforth/events/sc/cyoa-screcruit3.df"
msgid ""
"You must have known the group is full. Are you some kind of dingus or something?\r\n"
"\t\t"
msgstr ""
"일행이 꽉 찬 거 알았잖아. 너 무슨 멍청이야?\r\n"
"\t\t"

#: deathforth/events/sc/cyoa-screcruit3.df:97
msgctxt "deathforth/events/sc/cyoa-screcruit3.df"
msgid " throws in an eye roll, for free."
msgstr "은(는) 덤으로 눈까지 굴린다."

#: deathforth/events/sc/cyoa-screcruit3.df:99
msgctxt "deathforth/events/sc/cyoa-screcruit3.df"
msgid " chortles. "
msgstr "은(는) 킬킬거린다. "

#: deathforth/events/sc/cyoa-screcruit3.df:99
msgctxt "deathforth/events/sc/cyoa-screcruit3.df"
msgid ""
"\r\n"
"\tYeah I bet you want me to join you. How about you pay me up front?"
msgstr ""
"\r\n"
"\t그래, 내가 합류했으면 좋겠지. 선불로 내는 게 어때?"

#: deathforth/events/sc/cyoa-screcruit3.df:102
msgctxt "deathforth/events/sc/cyoa-screcruit3.df"
msgid "Give him 20 food"
msgstr "식량 20 준다"

#: deathforth/events/sc/cyoa-screcruit3.df:105
msgctxt "deathforth/events/sc/cyoa-screcruit3.df"
msgid "Give him "
msgstr "식량 "

#: deathforth/events/sc/cyoa-screcruit3.df:105
#: deathforth/events/sc/cyoa-screcruit3.df:289
msgctxt "deathforth/events/sc/cyoa-screcruit3.df"
msgid " food"
msgstr " 준다"

#: deathforth/events/sc/cyoa-screcruit3.df:107
msgctxt "deathforth/events/sc/cyoa-screcruit3.df"
msgid "Refuse and leave"
msgstr "거절하고 떠난다"

#: deathforth/events/sc/cyoa-screcruit3.df:111
msgctxt "deathforth/events/sc/cyoa-screcruit3.df"
msgid "Whatta Jerk"
msgstr "진짜 재수 없는 놈"

#: deathforth/events/sc/cyoa-screcruit3.df:116
msgctxt "deathforth/events/sc/cyoa-screcruit3.df"
msgid ""
" finds a mansion that has a bunch of random crap in it. There are a lot of expensive and also now useless TVs strewn about, some still in their boxes. Bottles are everywhere. Outside, there's a muscle car crashed into the stagnant pool.\r\n"
"\t"
msgstr ""
"은(는) 잡동사니가 잔뜩 있는 저택을 발견한다. 비싸지만 이제는 쓸모없는 TV들이 널려 있고, 몇 개는 아직 상자에 들어 있다. 병이 사방에 굴러다닌다. 밖에는 머슬카가 고인 수영장에 처박혀 있다.\r\n"
"\t"

#: deathforth/events/sc/cyoa-screcruit3.df:117
msgctxt "deathforth/events/sc/cyoa-screcruit3.df"
msgid ""
"Hey, get the heck out of my house!\r\n"
"\t"
msgstr ""
"야, 내 집에서 당장 나가!\r\n"
"\t"

#: deathforth/events/sc/cyoa-screcruit3.df:118
msgctxt "deathforth/events/sc/cyoa-screcruit3.df"
msgid ""
"A man appears, introducing himself as the mayor of the town. He corrects "
"himself and says he's the Governor-Emperor."
msgstr "한 남자가 나타나 자기가 이 마을 시장이라고 소개한다. 그러다 자기는 총독 겸 황제라고 정정한다."

#: deathforth/events/sc/cyoa-screcruit3.df:119
msgctxt "deathforth/events/sc/cyoa-screcruit3.df"
msgid "Recruit him"
msgstr "영입한다"

#: deathforth/events/sc/cyoa-screcruit3.df:120
msgctxt "deathforth/events/sc/cyoa-screcruit3.df"
msgid "Leave him be"
msgstr "내버려 둔다"

#: deathforth/events/sc/cyoa-screcruit3.df:127
msgctxt "deathforth/events/sc/cyoa-screcruit3.df"
msgid ""
" suggests that you let her tie a rope to the bumper of the car, and she can just hold onto it as you drive. That way, car space won't be an issue.\r\n"
"\t\tThat is a terrible idea. Kick someone out to make room:"
msgstr ""
"은(는) 차 범퍼에 밧줄을 묶어 주면 그걸 잡고 따라가겠다고 한다. 그러면 차 자리 문제는 없다고.\r\n"
"\t\t끔찍한 생각이다. 자리를 만들려면 누군가 내보내야 한다:"

#: deathforth/events/sc/cyoa-screcruit3.df:130
msgctxt "deathforth/events/sc/cyoa-screcruit3.df"
msgid ""
" agrees to join, as long as she's able to smash things to her heart's "
"content."
msgstr "은(는) 마음껏 물건을 부술 수 있다면 합류하겠다고 한다."

#: deathforth/events/sc/cyoa-screcruit3.df:136
msgctxt "deathforth/events/sc/cyoa-screcruit3.df"
msgid "The Big Rollerderby"
msgstr "빅 롤러 더비"

#: deathforth/events/sc/cyoa-screcruit3.df:140
msgctxt "deathforth/events/sc/cyoa-screcruit3.df"
msgid ""
" stumbles onto an abandoned rollerskating rink. Inside is a woman zipping around on skates as a zombie lurches towards her. The zombie isn't gaining any ground.\r\n"
"\tShe does a little twirl and then splatters the zombie with a wrench, never stumbling as she resumes her skating."
msgstr ""
"은(는) 버려진 롤러스케이트장을 우연히 발견한다. 안에서 한 여자가 스케이트를 타고 쌩쌩 달리고, 좀비 하나가 비틀대며 쫓아간다. 좀비는 전혀 따라잡지 못한다.\r\n"
"\t그녀는 살짝 회전하더니 렌치로 좀비를 박살 내고, 휘청임 없이 다시 스케이트를 탄다."

#: deathforth/events/sc/cyoa-screcruit3.df:142
msgctxt "deathforth/events/sc/cyoa-screcruit3.df"
msgid "Recruit her"
msgstr "영입한다"

#: deathforth/events/sc/cyoa-screcruit3.df:143
#: deathforth/events/sc/cyoa-screcruit3.df:252
msgctxt "deathforth/events/sc/cyoa-screcruit3.df"
msgid "Leave her be"
msgstr "내버려 둔다"

#: deathforth/events/sc/cyoa-screcruit3.df:147
msgctxt "deathforth/events/sc/cyoa-screcruit3.df"
msgid " jams "
msgstr "은(는) "

#: deathforth/events/sc/cyoa-screcruit3.df:147
msgctxt "deathforth/events/sc/cyoa-screcruit3.df"
msgid " foot into the gas pedal and "
msgstr " 발로 가속 페달을 꽉 밟는다. "

#: deathforth/events/sc/cyoa-screcruit3.df:147
msgctxt "deathforth/events/sc/cyoa-screcruit3.df"
msgid "FLOORS IT! "
msgstr "풀악셀! "

#: deathforth/events/sc/cyoa-screcruit3.df:153
msgctxt "deathforth/events/sc/cyoa-screcruit3.df"
msgid " turns "
msgstr "는 "

#: deathforth/events/sc/cyoa-screcruit3.df:153
msgctxt "deathforth/events/sc/cyoa-screcruit3.df"
msgid " head to the right and the clown is right there in the car with "
msgstr " 고개를 오른쪽으로 돌린다. 광대가 차 안, 바로 옆자리에 있다. 기겁한 건 "

#: deathforth/events/sc/cyoa-screcruit3.df:153
msgctxt "deathforth/events/sc/cyoa-screcruit3.df"
msgid ""
". \r\n"
"\t\tWith a blink, the clown is gone. Maybe a hallucination?"
msgstr ""
". \r\n"
"\t\t눈을 깜빡이자 광대가 사라진다. 환각이었을까?"

#: deathforth/events/sc/cyoa-screcruit3.df:156
msgctxt "deathforth/events/sc/cyoa-screcruit3.df"
msgid ""
"But there's no escape. It's already in the car. \r\n"
"\tMaybe it was always in the car."
msgstr ""
"하지만 도망칠 곳은 없다. 그건 이미 차 안에 있다. \r\n"
"\t어쩌면 처음부터 차 안에 있었을지도."

#: deathforth/events/sc/cyoa-screcruit3.df:163
msgctxt "deathforth/events/sc/cyoa-screcruit3.df"
msgid "Why did you do that? Why?"
msgstr "왜 그랬어? 왜?"

#: deathforth/events/sc/cyoa-screcruit3.df:168
msgctxt "deathforth/events/sc/cyoa-screcruit3.df"
msgid "Some kind of nightmare?"
msgstr "무슨 악몽이야?"

#: deathforth/events/sc/cyoa-screcruit3.df:171
msgctxt "deathforth/events/sc/cyoa-screcruit3.df"
msgid "is a funny clown!"
msgstr "은(는) 웃긴 광대다!"

#: deathforth/events/sc/cyoa-screcruit3.df:176
msgctxt "deathforth/events/sc/cyoa-screcruit3.df"
msgid ""
"The car is driving down the highway and it approaches a figure in the rain.\r\n"
"\t"
msgstr ""
"차가 고속도로를 달리다 빗속의 형체에 다가간다.\r\n"
"\t"

#: deathforth/events/sc/cyoa-screcruit3.df:177
msgctxt "deathforth/events/sc/cyoa-screcruit3.df"
msgid ""
" slows down to see who it is.\r\n"
"\tIt's a clown. It holds out a little clown horn and honks. The sound is so distorted."
msgstr ""
"은(는) 누군지 보려고 속도를 줄인다.\r\n"
"\t광대다. 작은 광대 나팔을 내밀어 빵빵 울린다. 소리가 너무 일그러져 있다."

#: deathforth/events/sc/cyoa-screcruit3.df:181
msgctxt "deathforth/events/sc/cyoa-screcruit3.df"
msgid " is deeply disturbed and vows to forget this ever happened."
msgstr "는 깊이 동요해서, 이 일을 잊기로 맹세한다."

#: deathforth/events/sc/cyoa-screcruit3.df:183
msgctxt "deathforth/events/sc/cyoa-screcruit3.df"
msgid "Let the clown in the car"
msgstr "광대를 차에 태운다"

#: deathforth/events/sc/cyoa-screcruit3.df:184
msgctxt "deathforth/events/sc/cyoa-screcruit3.df"
msgid "FLOOR IT"
msgstr "풀악셀"

#: deathforth/events/sc/cyoa-screcruit3.df:188
msgctxt "deathforth/events/sc/cyoa-screcruit3.df"
msgid ""
" eats a huge Thanksgiving meal.\r\n"
"\tDelicious!\r\n"
"\tThere's even some leftovers!"
msgstr ""
"은(는) 푸짐한 추수감사절 만찬을 먹는다.\r\n"
"\t맛있다!\r\n"
"\t남은 음식까지 있다!"

#: deathforth/events/sc/cyoa-screcruit3.df:202
msgctxt "deathforth/events/sc/cyoa-screcruit3.df"
msgid "Big mistake! Now the turkey thinks "
msgstr "큰 실수! 이제 칠면조는 "

#: deathforth/events/sc/cyoa-screcruit3.df:202
msgctxt "deathforth/events/sc/cyoa-screcruit3.df"
msgid ""
" is its mother!\r\n"
"\t\tIt starts following "
msgstr ""
"이(가) 자기 엄마라고 생각한다!\r\n"
"\t\t칠면조가 따라다니기 시작한다: "

#: deathforth/events/sc/cyoa-screcruit3.df:203
msgctxt "deathforth/events/sc/cyoa-screcruit3.df"
msgid " around."
msgstr " 뒤를 졸졸."

#: deathforth/events/sc/cyoa-screcruit3.df:208
msgctxt "deathforth/events/sc/cyoa-screcruit3.df"
msgid "HAPPY THANKSGIVING"
msgstr "해피 추수감사절"

#: deathforth/events/sc/cyoa-screcruit3.df:214
msgctxt "deathforth/events/sc/cyoa-screcruit3.df"
msgid ""
"It's that time of the year! A turkey appears!\r\n"
"\tIt's pretty big so it might actually be a guy in a turkey suit.\r\n"
"\tNo one can say for sure."
msgstr ""
"그 계절이 왔다! 칠면조가 나타났다!\r\n"
"\t꽤 큰 걸 보니 칠면조 옷을 입은 사람일지도.\r\n"
"\t아무도 확신할 수 없다."

#: deathforth/events/sc/cyoa-screcruit3.df:217
msgctxt "deathforth/events/sc/cyoa-screcruit3.df"
msgid "Eat Turkey"
msgstr "칠면조를 먹는다"

#: deathforth/events/sc/cyoa-screcruit3.df:218
msgctxt "deathforth/events/sc/cyoa-screcruit3.df"
msgid "Spare Turkey"
msgstr "칠면조를 살려 준다"

#: deathforth/events/sc/cyoa-screcruit3.df:223
msgctxt "deathforth/events/sc/cyoa-screcruit3.df"
msgid ""
" hops down and slams a smoke bomb into the ground.\r\n"
"\tShe's gone!"
msgstr ""
"은(는) 뛰어내리며 연막탄을 바닥에 내리꽂는다.\r\n"
"\t사라졌다!"

#: deathforth/events/sc/cyoa-screcruit3.df:229
msgctxt "deathforth/events/sc/cyoa-screcruit3.df"
msgid ""
" takes the food and then slams a smoke bomb into the ground. She's gone!\r\n"
"\tNo wait, she's in the car now."
msgstr ""
"은(는) 식량을 받더니 연막탄을 바닥에 내리꽂는다. 사라졌다!\r\n"
"\t아니, 잠깐, 이제 차 안에 있다."

#: deathforth/events/sc/cyoa-screcruit3.df:232
msgctxt "deathforth/events/sc/cyoa-screcruit3.df"
msgid "Boot someone from the team to make room:"
msgstr "자리를 만들려면 일행에서 누군가 빼야 한다:"

#: deathforth/events/sc/cyoa-screcruit3.df:241
msgctxt "deathforth/events/sc/cyoa-screcruit3.df"
msgid "Ninja Strike 3: Third Strike"
msgstr "닌자 스트라이크 3: 써드 스트라이크"

#: deathforth/events/sc/cyoa-screcruit3.df:246
msgctxt "deathforth/events/sc/cyoa-screcruit3.df"
msgid ""
" finds a trail of zombies, all cleanly cut in half.\r\n"
"\tFollowing the trail leads to someone dressed in a ninja costume, standing on a dumpster with a dramatic crossing-arms pose. Her impractical-length headband waves in the wind."
msgstr ""
"은(는) 깔끔하게 반으로 잘린 좀비들이 줄지어 있는 걸 발견한다.\r\n"
"\t그 흔적을 따라가니, 닌자 복장을 한 사람이 쓰레기통 위에서 팔짱을 끼고 극적인 포즈를 잡고 있다. 쓸데없이 긴 머리띠가 바람에 휘날린다."

#: deathforth/events/sc/cyoa-screcruit3.df:249
msgctxt "deathforth/events/sc/cyoa-screcruit3.df"
msgid "Bribe her to join for 10 food"
msgstr "식량 10으로 꼬드겨 합류시킨다"

#: deathforth/events/sc/cyoa-screcruit3.df:251
msgctxt "deathforth/events/sc/cyoa-screcruit3.df"
msgid "Approach her"
msgstr "다가간다"

#: deathforth/events/sc/cyoa-screcruit3.df:257
msgctxt "deathforth/events/sc/cyoa-screcruit3.df"
msgid ""
" seems disappointed by the amount of food you gave her, but only for the briefest moment.\r\n"
"\t"
msgstr ""
"은(는) 너희가 준 식량 양에 실망한 것 같지만, 아주 잠깐뿐이다.\r\n"
"\t"

#: deathforth/events/sc/cyoa-screcruit3.df:258
msgctxt "deathforth/events/sc/cyoa-screcruit3.df"
msgid "Thanks for the cat food! Please pet the kitties! "
msgstr "고양이 밥 고마워! 냥이들 쓰다듬어 줘! "

#: deathforth/events/sc/cyoa-screcruit3.df:265
msgctxt "deathforth/events/sc/cyoa-screcruit3.df"
msgid ""
" is delighted by the makeshift cat food!\r\n"
"\t\tShe shows the group her special reserve of cats dressed in little clothes and the ones that are less likely to bite hard enough to draw blood."
msgstr ""
"은(는) 임시 고양이 밥에 기뻐한다!\r\n"
"\t\t그녀는 일행에게 작은 옷을 입은 특별 고양이들과, 피가 날 만큼 세게 물 가능성이 적은 고양이들을 보여 준다."

#: deathforth/events/sc/cyoa-screcruit3.df:269
msgctxt "deathforth/events/sc/cyoa-screcruit3.df"
msgid "Much like the cats she loves, "
msgstr "자기가 사랑하는 고양이들처럼, "

#: deathforth/events/sc/cyoa-screcruit3.df:269
msgctxt "deathforth/events/sc/cyoa-screcruit3.df"
msgid ""
" now sees you as a source of food that she can then give directly with her "
"cats. She starts following you around."
msgstr "은(는) 이제 너희를 고양이에게 바로 줄 수 있는 먹이 공급원으로 본다. 너희를 따라다니기 시작한다."

#: deathforth/events/sc/cyoa-screcruit3.df:277
msgctxt "deathforth/events/sc/cyoa-screcruit3.df"
msgid "House of Meows"
msgstr "야옹의 집"

#: deathforth/events/sc/cyoa-screcruit3.df:282
msgctxt "deathforth/events/sc/cyoa-screcruit3.df"
msgid ""
" detects an overpowering stench, different from the usual smell of death.\r\n"
"\tThey follow it to a house full of cats. No one has seen a cat for ages!\r\n"
"\tA woman is among the cats, and she asks right away if "
msgstr ""
"은(는) 평소의 죽음 냄새와는 다른, 압도적인 악취를 감지한다.\r\n"
"\t냄새를 따라가니 고양이로 가득한 집이 나온다. 고양이를 본 지가 얼마 만인지!\r\n"
"\t고양이들 사이에 한 여자가 있고, 대뜸 묻는다. "

#: deathforth/events/sc/cyoa-screcruit3.df:284
msgctxt "deathforth/events/sc/cyoa-screcruit3.df"
msgid " has any spare cat food."
msgstr "에게 남는 고양이 사료가 있냐고."

#: deathforth/events/sc/cyoa-screcruit3.df:286
msgctxt "deathforth/events/sc/cyoa-screcruit3.df"
msgid "Give her 8 food"
msgstr "식량 8 준다"

#: deathforth/events/sc/cyoa-screcruit3.df:289
msgctxt "deathforth/events/sc/cyoa-screcruit3.df"
msgid "Give her "
msgstr "식량 "

#: deathforth/events/sc/cyoa-screcruit3.df:291
msgctxt "deathforth/events/sc/cyoa-screcruit3.df"
msgid "Can't spare the food"
msgstr "식량을 줄 여유가 없다"

#: deathforth/events/sc/cyoa-screcruit4.df:20
msgctxt "deathforth/events/sc/cyoa-screcruit4.df"
msgid ""
" says something but it's too muffled to understand.\r\n"
"\tWelcome to a new world of terror."
msgstr ""
"은(는) 뭔가 말하지만 너무 웅얼거려서 알아들을 수 없다.\r\n"
"\t공포의 신세계에 온 걸 환영한다."

#: deathforth/events/sc/cyoa-screcruit4.df:23
msgctxt "deathforth/events/sc/cyoa-screcruit4.df"
msgid "You'll have to boot someone to make room for this abomination:"
msgstr "이 괴물 자리를 만들려면 누군가 내보내야 한다:"

#: deathforth/events/sc/cyoa-screcruit4.df:30
msgctxt "deathforth/events/sc/cyoa-screcruit4.df"
msgid "The Final Monday"
msgstr "마지막 월요일"

#: deathforth/events/sc/cyoa-screcruit4.df:35
msgctxt "deathforth/events/sc/cyoa-screcruit4.df"
msgid " is scavenging through a restaurant, finding nothing. "
msgstr "은(는) 식당을 뒤지지만 아무것도 못 찾는다. "

#: deathforth/events/sc/cyoa-screcruit4.df:35
msgctxt "deathforth/events/sc/cyoa-screcruit4.df"
msgid ""
" discovers a deflated, filthy life-sized mascot character against one of the walls.\r\n"
"\tSuddenly, the mascot moves and screams:\r\n"
"\t"
msgstr ""
"은(는) 벽에 기대 놓인, 바람 빠지고 더러운 실물 크기 마스코트를 발견한다.\r\n"
"\t갑자기 마스코트가 움직이며 비명을 지른다:\r\n"
"\t"

#: deathforth/events/sc/cyoa-screcruit4.df:37
msgctxt "deathforth/events/sc/cyoa-screcruit4.df"
msgid ""
"I FREAKING HATE MONDAYS\r\n"
"\t"
msgstr ""
"월요일 진짜 싫어\r\n"
"\t"

#: deathforth/events/sc/cyoa-screcruit4.df:38
msgctxt "deathforth/events/sc/cyoa-screcruit4.df"
msgid " almost passes out from surprise."
msgstr "은(는) 놀라서 기절할 뻔한다."

#: deathforth/events/sc/cyoa-screcruit4.df:39
msgctxt "deathforth/events/sc/cyoa-screcruit4.df"
msgid "Recruit for some reason"
msgstr "왠지 모르게 영입한다"

#: deathforth/events/sc/cyoa-screcruit4.df:40
msgctxt "deathforth/events/sc/cyoa-screcruit4.df"
msgid "Get out of there fast"
msgstr "얼른 빠져나간다"

#: deathforth/events/sc/cyoa-screcruit4.df:48
msgctxt "deathforth/events/sc/cyoa-screcruit4.df"
msgid ""
" sparkles, lifts her LOVELY WAND, and emits heart beams.\r\n"
"\t"
msgstr ""
"은(는) 반짝이며 러블리 완드를 들어 하트 빔을 쏜다.\r\n"
"\t"

#: deathforth/events/sc/cyoa-screcruit4.df:49
msgctxt "deathforth/events/sc/cyoa-screcruit4.df"
msgid "A new team! Let's make a difference!"
msgstr "새 팀이다! 세상을 바꿔 보자!"

#: deathforth/events/sc/cyoa-screcruit4.df:51
msgctxt "deathforth/events/sc/cyoa-screcruit4.df"
msgid "The group's too big to recruit her! Replace someone:"
msgstr "일행이 너무 많아서 그녀를 영입할 수 없다! 누군가 빼야 한다:"

#: deathforth/events/sc/cyoa-screcruit4.df:59
msgctxt "deathforth/events/sc/cyoa-screcruit4.df"
msgid "The Power of Anime"
msgstr "애니의 힘"

#: deathforth/events/sc/cyoa-screcruit4.df:62
msgctxt "deathforth/events/sc/cyoa-screcruit4.df"
msgid " gets ambushed by a horde of zombies. While running, "
msgstr "은(는) 좀비 떼에게 기습당한다. 도망치던 중, "

#: deathforth/events/sc/cyoa-screcruit4.df:62
msgctxt "deathforth/events/sc/cyoa-screcruit4.df"
msgid " encounter"
msgstr "은(는)"

#: deathforth/events/sc/cyoa-screcruit4.df:62
msgctxt "deathforth/events/sc/cyoa-screcruit4.df"
msgid ""
" a woman, already swarmed into a corner.\r\n"
"\tIt looks hopeless, then she suddenly turns into an "
msgstr ""
" 이미 구석에 몰린 여자를 마주친다.\r\n"
"\t가망 없어 보였는데, 그녀가 갑자기 이것으로 변신한다: "

#: deathforth/events/sc/cyoa-screcruit4.df:63
msgctxt "deathforth/events/sc/cyoa-screcruit4.df"
msgid "ANIME MAGICAL GIRL"
msgstr "애니 마법 소녀"

#: deathforth/events/sc/cyoa-screcruit4.df:63
msgctxt "deathforth/events/sc/cyoa-screcruit4.df"
msgid ""
".\r\n"
"\tThe zombies don't have a chance against this."
msgstr ""
".\r\n"
"\t좀비들은 상대가 안 된다."

#: deathforth/events/sc/cyoa-screcruit4.df:65
#: deathforth/events/sc/cyoa-screcruit4.df:138
msgctxt "deathforth/events/sc/cyoa-screcruit4.df"
msgid "Recruit her"
msgstr "영입한다"

#: deathforth/events/sc/cyoa-screcruit4.df:66
msgctxt "deathforth/events/sc/cyoa-screcruit4.df"
msgid "Part ways"
msgstr "헤어진다"

#: deathforth/events/sc/cyoa-screcruit4.df:72
msgctxt "deathforth/events/sc/cyoa-screcruit4.df"
msgid ""
" finds a rowboat. It takes awhile to get to the old man. The man doesn't "
"talk and his expression is hard to read, but he steps on your boat."
msgstr ""
"은(는) 노 젓는 배를 찾는다. 노인에게 가는 데 한참 걸린다. 남자는 말이 없고 표정도 읽기 힘들지만, 너희 배에 올라탄다."

#: deathforth/events/sc/cyoa-screcruit4.df:74
msgctxt "deathforth/events/sc/cyoa-screcruit4.df"
msgid "Kick someone out to make room for him:"
msgstr "그를 태우려면 누군가 내보내야 한다:"

#: deathforth/events/sc/cyoa-screcruit4.df:81
msgctxt "deathforth/events/sc/cyoa-screcruit4.df"
msgid "Ridiculous Screenshake"
msgstr "말도 안 되는 화면 흔들림"

#: deathforth/events/sc/cyoa-screcruit4.df:86
msgctxt "deathforth/events/sc/cyoa-screcruit4.df"
msgid ""
" is taking a break near a lake.\r\n"
"\tThere's an old man in a boat in the distance, fishing.\r\n"
"\tHe flips the fishing rod and dozens of fish fly high into the air. He then gets out a pistol and starts shooting them. The world seems to shake.\r\n"
"\tDuring the middle of this, he switches out for a shotgun."
msgstr ""
"은(는) 호숫가에서 쉬고 있다.\r\n"
"\t멀리 배 위에서 노인이 낚시를 하고 있다.\r\n"
"\t그가 낚싯대를 휙 젖히자 물고기 수십 마리가 하늘 높이 날아오른다. 그러고는 권총을 꺼내 쏘기 시작한다. 세상이 흔들리는 것 같다.\r\n"
"\t그러다 중간에 산탄총으로 바꿔 든다."

#: deathforth/events/sc/cyoa-screcruit4.df:90
#: deathforth/events/sc/cyoa-screcruit4.df:113
#: deathforth/events/sc/cyoa-screcruit4.df:198
#: deathforth/events/sc/cyoa-screcruit4.df:228
msgctxt "deathforth/events/sc/cyoa-screcruit4.df"
msgid "Recruit him"
msgstr "영입한다"

#: deathforth/events/sc/cyoa-screcruit4.df:91
#: deathforth/events/sc/cyoa-screcruit4.df:114
msgctxt "deathforth/events/sc/cyoa-screcruit4.df"
msgid "Leave him be"
msgstr "내버려 둔다"

#: deathforth/events/sc/cyoa-screcruit4.df:97
msgctxt "deathforth/events/sc/cyoa-screcruit4.df"
msgid ""
" seems to accept your offer. He didn't say anything or even react at all, "
"except he did get into the car. If he doesn't jump out, then it's a done "
"deal."
msgstr "은(는) 제안을 받아들인 것 같다. 아무 말도, 아무 반응도 없었지만 차에는 탔다. 뛰어내리지만 않으면 거래 성사다."

#: deathforth/events/sc/cyoa-screcruit4.df:99
msgctxt "deathforth/events/sc/cyoa-screcruit4.df"
msgid "You'll need to boot someone else out to make room:"
msgstr "자리를 만들려면 다른 누군가를 내보내야 한다:"

#: deathforth/events/sc/cyoa-screcruit4.df:109
msgctxt "deathforth/events/sc/cyoa-screcruit4.df"
msgid ""
" finds a man in a bathroom.\r\n"
"\tThe man says nothing.\r\n"
"\tHe may be upset that you barged into a bathroom, but his face is expressionless. So who knows.\r\n"
"\tHe's purple for some reason. Pinkish-purple."
msgstr ""
"은(는) 화장실에서 한 남자를 발견한다.\r\n"
"\t남자는 아무 말도 하지 않는다.\r\n"
"\t화장실에 쳐들어와서 화났을 수도 있지만, 표정이 없다. 그러니 알 수 없다.\r\n"
"\t왠지 보라색이다. 분홍빛 보라색."

#: deathforth/events/sc/cyoa-screcruit4.df:119
msgctxt "deathforth/events/sc/cyoa-screcruit4.df"
msgid ""
" spins her mop rapidly around her wrist.\r\n"
"\t"
msgstr ""
"은(는) 대걸레를 손목에서 빠르게 빙글빙글 돌린다.\r\n"
"\t"

#: deathforth/events/sc/cyoa-screcruit4.df:120
msgctxt "deathforth/events/sc/cyoa-screcruit4.df"
msgid ""
"Time to clean up this mess!\r\n"
"\t"
msgstr ""
"이 난장판을 청소할 시간이야!\r\n"
"\t"

#: deathforth/events/sc/cyoa-screcruit4.df:121
msgctxt "deathforth/events/sc/cyoa-screcruit4.df"
msgid "Mop water soaks "
msgstr "걸레 물에 "

#: deathforth/events/sc/cyoa-screcruit4.df:121
msgctxt "deathforth/events/sc/cyoa-screcruit4.df"
msgid " pretty bad."
msgstr "이(가) 꽤 흠뻑 젖는다."

#: deathforth/events/sc/cyoa-screcruit4.df:123
msgctxt "deathforth/events/sc/cyoa-screcruit4.df"
msgid "Remove someone to make room:"
msgstr "자리를 만들려면 누군가 빼야 한다:"

#: deathforth/events/sc/cyoa-screcruit4.df:129
msgctxt "deathforth/events/sc/cyoa-screcruit4.df"
msgid "Cleaning Up"
msgstr "청소 시간"

#: deathforth/events/sc/cyoa-screcruit4.df:134
msgctxt "deathforth/events/sc/cyoa-screcruit4.df"
msgid ""
"You find a woman in an abandoned town, resting in a looted store.\r\n"
"\tShe's wearing a cleaning uniform.\r\n"
"\t"
msgstr ""
"버려진 마을의 털린 가게에서 쉬고 있는 여자를 발견한다.\r\n"
"\t청소부 유니폼을 입고 있다.\r\n"
"\t"

#: deathforth/events/sc/cyoa-screcruit4.df:136
msgctxt "deathforth/events/sc/cyoa-screcruit4.df"
msgid ""
"I wear these clothes because they're comfortable and stain resistant.\r\n"
"\t\tAnd I use this mop as a weapon because it's a good weapon! That's all! Stop asking me questions!"
msgstr ""
"이 옷은 편하고 얼룩이 잘 안 묻어서 입는 거야.\r\n"
"\t\t그리고 이 대걸레는 좋은 무기라서 무기로 쓰는 거고! 그게 다야! 그만 좀 물어봐!"

#: deathforth/events/sc/cyoa-screcruit4.df:139
msgctxt "deathforth/events/sc/cyoa-screcruit4.df"
msgid "Leave her be"
msgstr "내버려 둔다"

#: deathforth/events/sc/cyoa-screcruit4.df:145
msgctxt "deathforth/events/sc/cyoa-screcruit4.df"
msgid ""
" eases her metal self into the car. The suspension buckles a bit.\r\n"
"\t"
msgstr ""
"은(는) 금속 몸을 조심스럽게 차에 밀어 넣는다. 서스펜션이 살짝 휜다.\r\n"
"\t"

#: deathforth/events/sc/cyoa-screcruit4.df:146
msgctxt "deathforth/events/sc/cyoa-screcruit4.df"
msgid "Let's help one another on our quests!"
msgstr "서로의 여정을 도와주자!"

#: deathforth/events/sc/cyoa-screcruit4.df:148
msgctxt "deathforth/events/sc/cyoa-screcruit4.df"
msgid "You'll have to replace someone for the knight:"
msgstr "기사를 태우려면 누군가 빼야 한다:"

#: deathforth/events/sc/cyoa-screcruit4.df:156
msgctxt "deathforth/events/sc/cyoa-screcruit4.df"
msgid "Steel Hitchhiker"
msgstr "강철 히치하이커"

#: deathforth/events/sc/cyoa-screcruit4.df:160
msgctxt "deathforth/events/sc/cyoa-screcruit4.df"
msgid ""
" is driving north and sees a knight walking along the road, in full plate armor.\r\n"
"\tThe knight explains that she used to have a horse, but it got zombified."
msgstr ""
"은(는) 북쪽으로 달리다 판금 갑옷을 완전히 갖춰 입고 길을 걷는 기사를 본다.\r\n"
"\t기사는 말이 있었는데 좀비가 되어 버렸다고 설명한다."

#: deathforth/events/sc/cyoa-screcruit4.df:162
msgctxt "deathforth/events/sc/cyoa-screcruit4.df"
msgid " She offers to help you in your next battle, in exchange for a ride."
msgstr " 태워 주면 다음 전투에서 돕겠다고 한다."

#: deathforth/events/sc/cyoa-screcruit4.df:163
msgctxt "deathforth/events/sc/cyoa-screcruit4.df"
msgid "Accept offer"
msgstr "제안을 받아들인다"

#: deathforth/events/sc/cyoa-screcruit4.df:164
msgctxt "deathforth/events/sc/cyoa-screcruit4.df"
msgid "Decline offer"
msgstr "제안을 거절한다"

#: deathforth/events/sc/cyoa-screcruit4.df:170
msgctxt "deathforth/events/sc/cyoa-screcruit4.df"
msgid "The man ignores "
msgstr "남자는 무시한다. "

#: deathforth/events/sc/cyoa-screcruit4.df:170
msgctxt "deathforth/events/sc/cyoa-screcruit4.df"
msgid ""
"'s offer to join the group, but it soon becomes obvious that he just isn't listening.\r\n"
"\tThe car pulls ahead a bit and "
msgstr ""
"의 합류 제안을. 하지만 곧 그냥 안 듣고 있는 거라는 게 분명해진다.\r\n"
"\t차가 조금 앞으로 나가자 "

#: deathforth/events/sc/cyoa-screcruit4.df:171
msgctxt "deathforth/events/sc/cyoa-screcruit4.df"
msgid " reaches over and opens one of the back doors. The man jumps in."
msgstr "이(가) 손을 뻗어 뒷문을 연다. 남자가 뛰어든다."

#: deathforth/events/sc/cyoa-screcruit4.df:173
msgctxt "deathforth/events/sc/cyoa-screcruit4.df"
msgid "Boot someone out to get a horse:"
msgstr "말을 얻으려면 누군가 내보내야 한다:"

#: deathforth/events/sc/cyoa-screcruit4.df:181
msgctxt "deathforth/events/sc/cyoa-screcruit4.df"
msgid ""
" imagines what it would be like to be a horse.\r\n"
"\t"
msgstr ""
"은(는) 말이 된다는 게 어떤 기분일지 상상한다.\r\n"
"\t"

#: deathforth/events/sc/cyoa-screcruit4.df:182
msgctxt "deathforth/events/sc/cyoa-screcruit4.df"
msgid ""
"WOW\r\n"
"\tNICE\r\n"
"\tINCREDIBLE"
msgstr ""
"와\r\n"
"\t좋아\r\n"
"\t놀라워"

#: deathforth/events/sc/cyoa-screcruit4.df:189
msgctxt "deathforth/events/sc/cyoa-screcruit4.df"
msgid "A Lovely Horse"
msgstr "사랑스러운 말"

#: deathforth/events/sc/cyoa-screcruit4.df:195
msgctxt "deathforth/events/sc/cyoa-screcruit4.df"
msgid ""
"There's a man running alongside the road.\r\n"
"\tHis horse mask is flopping back and forth with every step.\r\n"
"\t"
msgstr ""
"한 남자가 길을 따라 달리고 있다.\r\n"
"\t말 가면이 걸음마다 펄럭인다.\r\n"
"\t"

#: deathforth/events/sc/cyoa-screcruit4.df:197
msgctxt "deathforth/events/sc/cyoa-screcruit4.df"
msgid " has never seen someone so free."
msgstr "은(는) 이렇게 자유로운 사람을 본 적이 없다."

#: deathforth/events/sc/cyoa-screcruit4.df:199
msgctxt "deathforth/events/sc/cyoa-screcruit4.df"
msgid "Imagine being a horse"
msgstr "말이 되는 상상을 한다"

#: deathforth/events/sc/cyoa-screcruit4.df:205
msgctxt "deathforth/events/sc/cyoa-screcruit4.df"
msgid ""
" flips out.\r\n"
"\t\t"
msgstr ""
"은(는) 폭발한다.\r\n"
"\t\t"

#: deathforth/events/sc/cyoa-screcruit4.df:206
msgctxt "deathforth/events/sc/cyoa-screcruit4.df"
msgid ""
"You can't RECRUIT anyone if you already have 4 people!\r\n"
"\t\tYou just can't do it! Haven't you been paying ATTENTION?\r\n"
"\t\t"
msgstr ""
"이미 4명인데 누굴 영입해!\r\n"
"\t\t그건 안 된다고! 집중 안 하고 있었어?\r\n"
"\t\t"

#: deathforth/events/sc/cyoa-screcruit4.df:208
msgctxt "deathforth/events/sc/cyoa-screcruit4.df"
msgid ""
" storms back into his hut and slams the door.\r\n"
"\t\tBoot someone from the group and try again:"
msgstr ""
"은(는) 오두막으로 쿵쿵대며 들어가 문을 쾅 닫는다.\r\n"
"\t\t일행에서 누군가 빼고 다시 해 봐라:"

#: deathforth/events/sc/cyoa-screcruit4.df:211
msgctxt "deathforth/events/sc/cyoa-screcruit4.df"
msgid ""
" jumps onto his rodent thing.\r\n"
"\t"
msgstr ""
"은(는) 설치류 같은 녀석 위로 뛰어오른다.\r\n"
"\t"

#: deathforth/events/sc/cyoa-screcruit4.df:212
msgctxt "deathforth/events/sc/cyoa-screcruit4.df"
msgid ""
"You have a ZOMBIE problem? That's GNOME PROBLEM.\r\n"
"\t"
msgstr ""
"좀비 문제가 있다고? 그건 노움 문제지.\r\n"
"\t"

#: deathforth/events/sc/cyoa-screcruit4.df:213
msgctxt "deathforth/events/sc/cyoa-screcruit4.df"
msgid ""
"The rodent rears back and whinnies dramatically.\r\n"
"\t"
msgstr ""
"설치류가 뒷발로 서더니 극적으로 힝힝 운다.\r\n"
"\t"

#: deathforth/events/sc/cyoa-screcruit4.df:214
msgctxt "deathforth/events/sc/cyoa-screcruit4.df"
msgid " points towards the horizon and winks. "
msgstr "은(는) 지평선을 가리키며 윙크한다. "

#: deathforth/events/sc/cyoa-screcruit4.df:220
msgctxt "deathforth/events/sc/cyoa-screcruit4.df"
msgid "THE TRIUMPHANT RETURN OF GNOMEY"
msgstr "노미의 화려한 귀환"

#: deathforth/events/sc/cyoa-screcruit4.df:225
msgctxt "deathforth/events/sc/cyoa-screcruit4.df"
msgid ""
" takes a wrong turn down a country road, and comes across a house.\r\n"
"\tThe house is a large mushroom, nearly as big as a person. There's a little gated area outside with some sort of exotic rodent grunting inside of it.\r\n"
"\tA gnome steps out of the house and starts "
msgstr ""
"은(는) 시골길에서 길을 잘못 들었다가 집 한 채를 발견한다.\r\n"
"\t집은 사람만 한 커다란 버섯이다. 밖엔 작은 울타리가 있고, 안에서 이국적인 설치류 같은 게 꿀꿀거린다.\r\n"
"\t노움이 집에서 나오더니 "

#: deathforth/events/sc/cyoa-screcruit4.df:227
msgctxt "deathforth/events/sc/cyoa-screcruit4.df"
msgid "SHRIEKING"
msgstr "비명을 지르기 시작하며"

#: deathforth/events/sc/cyoa-screcruit4.df:227
msgctxt "deathforth/events/sc/cyoa-screcruit4.df"
msgid " and pointing at you."
msgstr " 너희를 가리킨다."

#: deathforth/events/sc/cyoa-screcruit4.df:229
msgctxt "deathforth/events/sc/cyoa-screcruit4.df"
msgid "Run for the car"
msgstr "차로 도망친다"

#: deathforth/events/sc/cyoa-screcruit5.df:7
msgctxt "deathforth/events/sc/cyoa-screcruit5.df"
msgid ""
" climbs into the car. His ostentatious giant sword scrapes up against "
"everything, destroying the upholstery."
msgstr "은(는) 차에 올라탄다. 과시용 거대한 검이 사방을 긁어서 시트가 다 망가진다."

#: deathforth/events/sc/cyoa-screcruit5.df:9
msgctxt "deathforth/events/sc/cyoa-screcruit5.df"
msgid "Your party is full! Who should leave to make room?"
msgstr "일행이 꽉 찼다! 자리를 만들려면 누가 나가야 할까?"

#: deathforth/events/sc/cyoa-screcruit5.df:15
msgctxt "deathforth/events/sc/cyoa-screcruit5.df"
msgid "Level Grinding Required"
msgstr "레벨 노가다 필요"

#: deathforth/events/sc/cyoa-screcruit5.df:17
msgctxt "deathforth/events/sc/cyoa-screcruit5.df"
msgid ""
" spots a hitchhiker near the road.\r\n"
"\tHe wields a goofy enormous sword. It's obvious that it is way too big to swing effectively.\r\n"
"\tThe man is also Level 1, Level 2 at best. He'll need some serious powerleveling if he's going to fight "
msgstr ""
"은(는) 길가의 히치하이커를 발견한다.\r\n"
"\t우스꽝스럽게 거대한 검을 들고 있다. 제대로 휘두르기엔 너무 크다는 게 뻔하다.\r\n"
"\t남자는 레벨 1, 잘해야 레벨 2다. 이 게임 끝에서 이 녀석과 싸우려면 레벨을 엄청 올려야 한다: "

#: deathforth/events/sc/cyoa-screcruit5.df:19
msgctxt "deathforth/events/sc/cyoa-screcruit5.df"
msgid "Ultimate Ascended Bizarro-Krankor"
msgstr "궁극의 초월한 비자로-크랭코어"

#: deathforth/events/sc/cyoa-screcruit5.df:19
msgctxt "deathforth/events/sc/cyoa-screcruit5.df"
msgid " at the end of this game."
msgstr "."

#: deathforth/events/sc/cyoa-screcruit5.df:20
msgctxt "deathforth/events/sc/cyoa-screcruit5.df"
msgid "Recruit him"
msgstr "영입한다"

#: deathforth/events/sc/cyoa-screcruit5.df:21
msgctxt "deathforth/events/sc/cyoa-screcruit5.df"
msgid "Leave him be"
msgstr "내버려 둔다"

#: deathforth/events/sc/cyoa-screcruit5.df:26
msgctxt "deathforth/events/sc/cyoa-screcruit5.df"
msgid ""
" drives a few feet and almost runs over the monster. It turned out to be someone in a monster suit, stepping on a small cardboard city.\r\n"
"\t"
msgstr ""
"은(는) 몇 걸음 달리다 괴물을 칠 뻔한다. 알고 보니 괴물 옷을 입은 사람이 작은 골판지 도시를 밟고 있었다.\r\n"
"\t"

#: deathforth/events/sc/cyoa-screcruit5.df:27
msgctxt "deathforth/events/sc/cyoa-screcruit5.df"
msgid "Sorry, I'm stuck in this suit!"
msgstr "미안, 이 옷에서 못 빠져나가겠어!"

#: deathforth/events/sc/cyoa-screcruit5.df:27
msgctxt "deathforth/events/sc/cyoa-screcruit5.df"
msgid " She climbs into the car."
msgstr " 그녀가 차에 올라탄다."

#: deathforth/events/sc/cyoa-screcruit5.df:29
msgctxt "deathforth/events/sc/cyoa-screcruit5.df"
msgid "There's no room in the team for this monster! Who should leave?"
msgstr "이 괴물이 탈 자리가 없다! 누가 나가야 할까?"

#: deathforth/events/sc/cyoa-screcruit5.df:35
msgctxt "deathforth/events/sc/cyoa-screcruit5.df"
msgid "Giant Monster City"
msgstr "거대 괴수 도시"

#: deathforth/events/sc/cyoa-screcruit5.df:37
msgctxt "deathforth/events/sc/cyoa-screcruit5.df"
msgid ""
"A giant prehistoric monster is destroying the city!\r\n"
"\tIt's stomping around, obliterating buildings. Who knows how many cans of food it's crushing? \r\n"
"\tYou're the only one who can stop it!"
msgstr ""
"거대한 선사시대 괴수가 도시를 파괴하고 있다!\r\n"
"\t쿵쿵거리며 건물을 박살 낸다. 통조림이 얼마나 짓밟히고 있을지 누가 알겠어? \r\n"
"\t막을 수 있는 건 너희뿐이다!"

