msgctxt "deathforth/events/sc/dsyp.df"
msgid ""
" raises his arms to the heavens in despair.\r\n"
"\t\tHe just committed the ultimate mistake.\r\n"
"\t\t"
msgstr ""
"은(는) 절망에 빠져 두 팔을 하늘로 치켜든다.\r\n"
"\t\t그는 방금 최악의 실수를 저질렀다.\r\n"
"\t\t"

#: deathforth/events/sc/dsyp.df:10
msgctxt "deathforth/events/sc/dsyp.df"
msgid "He p**ped his pants."
msgstr "바지에 쌌다."

