msgctxt "deathforth/events/sc/dsyp.df"
msgid ""
"\r\n"
"\t\tThere's no redemption for this one."
msgstr ""
"\r\n"
"\t\t이건 만회할 방법이 없다."

#: deathforth/events/sc/dsyp.df:13
msgctxt "deathforth/events/sc/dsyp.df"
msgid ""
"His only consolation was that no one was around to see it.\r\n"
"\t\t\t"
msgstr ""
"유일한 위안은 본 사람이 아무도 없다는 것이었다.\r\n"
"\t\t\t"

#: deathforth/events/sc/dsyp.df:14
msgctxt "deathforth/events/sc/dsyp.df"
msgid "THE TRIP TO CANADA IS OVER"
msgstr "캐나다 여정은 끝났다"

#: deathforth/events/sc/dsyp.df:16
msgctxt "deathforth/events/sc/dsyp.df"
msgid ""
"He runs away before anyone else notices.\r\n"
"\t\t\t"
msgstr ""
"그는 남들이 눈치채기 전에 도망친다.\r\n"
"\t\t\t"

