msgctxt "deathforth/events/sc/dsyp.df"
msgid " has left the team!"
msgstr "이(가) 일행을 떠났다!"

#: deathforth/events/sc/evilsanta.df:9
msgctxt "deathforth/events/sc/evilsanta.df"
msgid ""
" emits an ear-piercing scream that shakes the earth. He then spontaneously "
"explodes into a flurry of snowflakes and what appears to be some sort of "
"glitter."
msgstr "은(는) 땅을 뒤흔드는 귀청 찢어지는 비명을 지른다. 그러고는 갑자기 눈송이와 반짝이 같은 것으로 폭발해 흩어진다."

#: deathforth/events/sc/evilsanta.df:12
msgctxt "deathforth/events/sc/evilsanta.df"
msgid "CHRISTMAS 2: THE CURSE CONTINUES"
msgstr "크리스마스 2: 저주는 계속된다"

#: deathforth/events/sc/evilsanta.df:13
msgctxt "deathforth/events/sc/evilsanta.df"
msgid " is horrified to breathe in these Santa spores."
msgstr "은(는) 이 산타 포자를 들이마시고 경악한다."

#: deathforth/events/sc/evilsanta.df:16
msgctxt "deathforth/events/sc/evilsanta.df"
msgid "FINAL CHRISTMAS: THE CHRISTMASING"
msgstr "파이널 크리스마스: 더 크리스마싱"

#: deathforth/events/sc/evilsanta.df:17
msgctxt "deathforth/events/sc/evilsanta.df"
msgid "That's it. Christmas is over, everyone."
msgstr "끝났다. 크리스마스는 끝났어, 여러분."

#: deathforth/events/sc/garf.df:4
msgctxt "deathforth/events/sc/garf.df"
msgid "Tuesday"
msgstr "화요일"

#: deathforth/events/sc/garf.df:5
msgctxt "deathforth/events/sc/garf.df"
msgid ""
" wanders through the forest outside of this world for a short time. \r\n"
"\t\tIn a blink, "
msgstr ""
"은(는) 잠시 이 세상 밖의 숲을 헤맨다. \r\n"
"\t\t눈 깜짝할 사이, "

#: deathforth/events/sc/garf.df:6
msgctxt "deathforth/events/sc/garf.df"
msgid " back to where "
msgstr "은(는) 돌아와 있다. "

#: deathforth/events/sc/garf.df:6
msgctxt "deathforth/events/sc/garf.df"
msgid ""
" before being transported to that place.\r\n"
"\t\tThat was terrifying!"
msgstr ""
"이(가) 그곳으로 끌려가기 전에 있던 자리로.\r\n"
"\t\t끔찍했다!"

#: deathforth/events/sc/garf.df:8
msgctxt "deathforth/events/sc/garf.df"
msgid " still hates Mondays."
msgstr "은(는) 여전히 월요일이 싫다."

#: deathforth/events/sc/garf.df:9
msgctxt "deathforth/events/sc/garf.df"
msgid " is nowhere to be seen."
msgstr "은(는) 어디에도 보이지 않는다."

#: deathforth/events/sc/garf.df:19
msgctxt "deathforth/events/sc/garf.df"
msgid "The Final Monday"
msgstr "마지막 월요일"

#: deathforth/events/sc/garf.df:20
msgctxt "deathforth/events/sc/garf.df"
msgid ""
" complains about Mondays to the empty car. Every day feels like a Monday.\r\n"
"\t\tIt slowly becomes transparent, then disappears. Fading into the Mondays from which it came."
msgstr ""
"은(는) 빈 차에 대고 월요일 불평을 한다. 매일이 월요일 같다.\r\n"
"\t\t그것은 천천히 투명해지더니 사라진다. 자기가 왔던 월요일 속으로 흩어진다."

#: deathforth/events/sc/garf.df:23
msgctxt "deathforth/events/sc/garf.df"
msgid "The Monday"
msgstr "월요일"

#: deathforth/events/sc/garf.df:24
msgctxt "deathforth/events/sc/garf.df"
msgid " is unhappy. It slowly takes off its head in front of "
msgstr "은(는) 불행하다. 그것은 천천히 자기 머리를 벗는다. 보고 있는 건 "

#: deathforth/events/sc/garf.df:25
msgctxt "deathforth/events/sc/garf.df"
msgid ". Time skips and the group is now in a strange forest. "
msgstr ". 시간이 건너뛰고 일행은 이제 이상한 숲에 있다. "

#: deathforth/events/sc/garf.df:25
msgctxt "deathforth/events/sc/garf.df"
msgid "THIS IS THE DAY THAT I HATE"
msgstr "이날이 내가 싫어하는 날이다"

#: deathforth/events/sc/garf.df:25
msgctxt "deathforth/events/sc/garf.df"
msgid " screams "
msgstr ", 비명을 지르는 건 "

#: deathforth/events/sc/garf.df:25
msgctxt "deathforth/events/sc/garf.df"
msgid "THIS IS MONDAY!"
msgstr "월요일이다!"

#: deathforth/events/sc/garf.df:28
msgctxt "deathforth/events/sc/garf.df"
msgid "What's going on?"
msgstr "무슨 일이야?"

#: deathforth/events/sc/gnomey.df:6
msgctxt "deathforth/events/sc/gnomey.df"
msgid "The Heartbreaking Conclusion"
msgstr "가슴 아픈 결말"

#: deathforth/events/sc/gnomey.df:7
msgctxt "deathforth/events/sc/gnomey.df"
msgid ""
" rides his rodent into the woods.\r\n"
"\t\tHe finds a quiet clearing and stands in the middle of it.\r\n"
"\t\tThere, he turns into a tree. Forever.\r\n"
"\t\tThe rodent witnesses this and tears form in its eyes.\r\n"
"\t\t"
msgstr ""
"은(는) 설치류를 타고 숲으로 들어간다.\r\n"
"\t\t조용한 빈터를 찾아 그 한가운데에 선다.\r\n"
"\t\t그리고 나무로 변한다. 영원히.\r\n"
"\t\t그걸 본 설치류의 눈에 눈물이 맺힌다.\r\n"
"\t\t"

#: deathforth/events/sc/gnomey.df:11
msgctxt "deathforth/events/sc/gnomey.df"
msgid "THE END.... OR IS IT?"
msgstr "끝.... 일까?"

#: deathforth/events/sc/gnomey.df:13
msgctxt "deathforth/events/sc/gnomey.df"
msgid "Gnome Fury"
msgstr "노움의 분노"

#: deathforth/events/sc/gnomey.df:14
msgctxt "deathforth/events/sc/gnomey.df"
msgid ""
" stomps and fumes in piping-hot rage.\r\n"
"\t\t"
msgstr ""
"은(는) 쿵쿵거리며 부글부글 끓는 분노를 뿜는다.\r\n"
"\t\t"

#: deathforth/events/sc/gnomey.df:15
msgctxt "deathforth/events/sc/gnomey.df"
msgid "OOOO! I'M SO ANGRY RIGHT NOW! OOOOOO!"
msgstr "우우우! 나 지금 엄청 화났어! 우우우우!"

#: deathforth/events/sc/gnomey.df:15
msgctxt "deathforth/events/sc/gnomey.df"
msgid ""
"\r\n"
"\t\tHis rodent runs away in a panic as "
msgstr ""
"\r\n"
"\t\t그의 설치류가 겁에 질려 도망친다. 그사이 "

#: deathforth/events/sc/gnomey.df:16
msgctxt "deathforth/events/sc/gnomey.df"
msgid ""
" starts to float into the air.\r\n"
"\t\tBeams of light emanate from his body, and with a flash, he's gone. His ghostly voice echoes all around:\r\n"
"\t\t"
msgstr ""
"은(는) 공중으로 떠오르기 시작한다.\r\n"
"\t\t몸에서 빛줄기가 뿜어져 나오고, 번쩍하더니 사라진다. 그의 유령 같은 목소리가 사방에 울린다:\r\n"
"\t\t"

#: deathforth/events/sc/gnomey.df:18
msgctxt "deathforth/events/sc/gnomey.df"
msgid "I'VE ASCENDED INTO GODHOOD NOW, YOU DINKS"
msgstr "나는 이제 신이 되었다, 이 얼간이들아"

#: deathforth/events/sc/gnomey.df:19
msgctxt "deathforth/events/sc/gnomey.df"
msgid " has left the team!"
msgstr "이(가) 일행을 떠났다!"

#: deathforth/events/sc/gnomey.df:20
msgctxt "deathforth/events/sc/gnomey.df"
msgid "However, he has left something behind in the trunk!"
msgstr "하지만 트렁크에 뭔가를 남겨 두고 갔다!"

#: deathforth/events/sc/horse.df:11
msgctxt "deathforth/events/sc/horse.df"
msgid "Horsin' Around"
msgstr "말처럼 뛰놀기"

#: deathforth/events/sc/horse.df:12
msgctxt "deathforth/events/sc/horse.df"
msgid ""
" just decides to start running.\r\n"
"\t\tHe runs and runs in one direction and never seems to stop."
msgstr ""
"은(는) 그냥 달리기 시작한다.\r\n"
"\t\t한 방향으로 달리고 또 달리는데, 멈출 생각이 없어 보인다."

#: deathforth/events/sc/horse.df:15
msgctxt "deathforth/events/sc/horse.df"
msgid "With no one to hold him back, he's finally free again."
msgstr "그를 붙잡을 사람이 없으니, 그는 드디어 다시 자유다."

#: deathforth/events/sc/horse.df:17
msgctxt "deathforth/events/sc/horse.df"
msgid ""
" of the team can only stand back and watch as he disappears over the "
"horizon."
msgstr "은(는) 그가 지평선 너머로 사라지는 걸 뒤에서 지켜볼 수밖에 없다."

#: deathforth/events/sc/horse.df:19
msgctxt "deathforth/events/sc/horse.df"
msgid " has left the team."
msgstr "이(가) 일행을 떠났다."

#: deathforth/events/sc/jerk.df:10
msgctxt "deathforth/events/sc/jerk.df"
msgid "WHAT A JERK"
msgstr "진짜 재수 없는 놈"

#: deathforth/events/sc/jerk.df:11
msgctxt "deathforth/events/sc/jerk.df"
msgid "In the middle of the night, "
msgstr "한밤중에, "

#: deathforth/events/sc/jerk.df:11
msgctxt "deathforth/events/sc/jerk.df"
msgid ""
" decides to steal as much of the food that he can carry before abandoning the mission.\r\n"
"\t"
msgstr ""
"은(는) 들 수 있는 만큼 식량을 훔쳐서 임무를 버리고 떠나기로 한다.\r\n"
"\t"

#: deathforth/events/sc/jerk.df:12
msgctxt "deathforth/events/sc/jerk.df"
msgid "What a jerk."
msgstr "진짜 재수 없다."

#: deathforth/events/sc/jerk.df:13
msgctxt "deathforth/events/sc/jerk.df"
msgid "At least there wasn't much to steal."
msgstr "그나마 훔쳐 갈 게 별로 없었다."

#: deathforth/events/sc/knight.df:9
msgctxt "deathforth/events/sc/knight.df"
msgid "Looks like"
msgstr "<EMPTY>"

#: deathforth/events/sc/knight.df:9
msgctxt "deathforth/events/sc/knight.df"
msgid "the knight"
msgstr "기사"

#: deathforth/events/sc/knight.df:9
msgctxt "deathforth/events/sc/knight.df"
msgid " won't get to continue her quest."
msgstr "은(는) 여정을 계속하지 못할 것 같다."

#: deathforth/events/sc/knight.df:10
msgctxt "deathforth/events/sc/knight.df"
msgid "Path of the Knight"
msgstr "기사의 길"

#: deathforth/events/sc/knight.df:12 deathforth/events/sc/knight.df:15
msgctxt "deathforth/events/sc/knight.df"
msgid "The knight"
msgstr "기사"

#: deathforth/events/sc/knight.df:12
msgctxt "deathforth/events/sc/knight.df"
msgid ""
" is close to her destination, so she exits the car to continue on her sacred quest.\r\n"
"\t\tHer questing continues, but there's no one left for the Canada quest."
msgstr ""
"은(는) 목적지에 거의 다 와서, 성스러운 여정을 계속하러 차에서 내린다.\r\n"
"\t\t그녀의 여정은 계속되지만, 캐나다 여정을 할 사람은 아무도 남지 않았다."

#: deathforth/events/sc/knight.df:15
msgctxt "deathforth/events/sc/knight.df"
msgid ""
" asks to be let out of the car.\r\n"
"\t"
msgstr ""
"은(는) 차에서 내려 달라고 한다.\r\n"
"\t"

#: deathforth/events/sc/knight.df:16
msgctxt "deathforth/events/sc/knight.df"
msgid "It's time for me to resume my quest!"
msgstr "이제 내 여정을 다시 떠날 때다!"

#: deathforth/events/sc/knight.df:16
msgctxt "deathforth/events/sc/knight.df"
msgid ""
"\r\n"
"\tIn thanks, she gives "
msgstr ""
"\r\n"
"\t고마움의 표시로 그녀가 준다. 받는 건 "

#: deathforth/events/sc/knight.df:17
msgctxt "deathforth/events/sc/knight.df"
msgid ""
" her spare sword!\r\n"
"\t"
msgstr ""
". 그녀의 여분 검이다!\r\n"
"\t"

#: deathforth/events/sc/knight.df:18
msgctxt "deathforth/events/sc/knight.df"
msgid "Knight's Sword"
msgstr "기사의 검"

#: deathforth/events/sc/knight.df:18
msgctxt "deathforth/events/sc/knight.df"
msgid " obtained!"
msgstr " 획득!"

#: deathforth/events/sc/knight.df:26
msgctxt "deathforth/events/sc/knight.df"
msgid "Well my FEELINGS aren't in plate armor"
msgstr "내 감정은 판금 갑옷을 안 입었다고"

#: deathforth/events/sc/knight.df:27
msgctxt "deathforth/events/sc/knight.df"
msgid ""
" decides she doesn't need any more of this crap. \r\n"
"\t"
msgstr ""
"은(는) 더는 이런 꼴 못 보겠다고 결정한다. \r\n"
"\t"

#: deathforth/events/sc/knight.df:28
msgctxt "deathforth/events/sc/knight.df"
msgid "This car is CURSED! I should have just found another horse!"
msgstr "이 차는 저주받았어! 그냥 다른 말을 찾을걸!"

#: deathforth/events/sc/knight.df:28
msgctxt "deathforth/events/sc/knight.df"
msgid ""
"\r\n"
"\tShe storms off angry, armor clanking."
msgstr ""
"\r\n"
"\t그녀는 갑옷을 쩔그럭거리며 화가 나서 떠나 버린다."

#: deathforth/events/sc/lnk.df:8
msgctxt "deathforth/events/sc/lnk.df"
msgid ""
" stumbles on a treasure chest. He opens it and lifts its contents high above his head.\r\n"
"\t\tIt contained the "
msgstr ""
"은(는) 보물 상자를 우연히 발견한다. 상자를 열고 내용물을 머리 위로 높이 치켜든다.\r\n"
"\t\t들어 있던 것은 "

#: deathforth/events/sc/lnk.df:22 deathforth/events/sc/lnk.df:34
msgctxt "deathforth/events/sc/lnk.df"
msgid " got the "
msgstr "이(가) 얻었다: "

#: deathforth/events/sc/lnk.df:22
msgctxt "deathforth/events/sc/lnk.df"
msgid "Heart Container!"
msgstr "하트 그릇!"

#: deathforth/events/sc/lnk.df:22
msgctxt "deathforth/events/sc/lnk.df"
msgid ""
"\r\n"
"\tMaximum Health has increased!"
msgstr ""
"\r\n"
"\t최대 체력이 증가했다!"

#: deathforth/events/sc/lnk.df:34
msgctxt "deathforth/events/sc/lnk.df"
msgid "Sack of Bombs!"
msgstr "폭탄 자루!"

#: deathforth/events/sc/lnk.df:34
msgctxt "deathforth/events/sc/lnk.df"
msgid ""
"\r\n"
"\tHe can now throw three bombs every mission! \r\n"
"\tNew bombs will show up in the trunk whenever they're fully used up!"
msgstr ""
"\r\n"
"\t이제 임무마다 폭탄 세 개를 던질 수 있다! \r\n"
"\t폭탄을 다 쓰면 트렁크에 새 폭탄이 나타난다!"

#: deathforth/events/sc/lnk.df:43
msgctxt "deathforth/events/sc/lnk.df"
msgid ""
" is no longer around. This is probably for the best. Please do not tell "
"anyone that we put this character in the game."
msgstr "은(는) 이제 없다. 아마 그게 최선일 거다. 이 캐릭터를 게임에 넣었다는 건 아무한테도 말하지 말아 주세요."

#: deathforth/events/sc/lnk.df:44
msgctxt "deathforth/events/sc/lnk.df"
msgid "DA NA NA NAAAAAAA!"
msgstr "다 나 나 나아아아아!"

#: deathforth/events/sc/lnk.df:46
msgctxt "deathforth/events/sc/lnk.df"
msgid "Wooden Boomerang!"
msgstr "나무 부메랑!"

#: deathforth/events/sc/lnk.df:50
msgctxt "deathforth/events/sc/lnk.df"
msgid "White Sword!"
msgstr "하얀 검!"

#: deathforth/events/sc/lnk.df:54
msgctxt "deathforth/events/sc/lnk.df"
msgid "Metal Boomerang!"
msgstr "금속 부메랑!"

#: deathforth/events/sc/lnk.df:58
msgctxt "deathforth/events/sc/lnk.df"
msgid ""
"\r\n"
"\t\tChoose One:"
msgstr ""
"\r\n"
"\t\t하나 고르세요:"

#: deathforth/events/sc/lnk.df:60
msgctxt "deathforth/events/sc/lnk.df"
msgid "Heart Container"
msgstr "하트 그릇"

#: deathforth/events/sc/lnk.df:61
msgctxt "deathforth/events/sc/lnk.df"
msgid "Sack of Bombs"
msgstr "폭탄 자루"

#: deathforth/events/sc/lnk.df:64
msgctxt "deathforth/events/sc/lnk.df"
msgid " Sword!"
msgstr " 검!"

#: deathforth/events/sc/lnk.df:78
msgctxt "deathforth/events/sc/lnk.df"
msgid "Spin Attack"
msgstr "회전 베기"

#: deathforth/events/sc/lnk.df:79
msgctxt "deathforth/events/sc/lnk.df"
msgid ""
" holds his sword in front of him, and then spins around at high speeds.\r\n"
"\t"
msgstr ""
"은(는) 검을 앞으로 들더니 엄청난 속도로 빙글빙글 돈다.\r\n"
"\t"

#: deathforth/events/sc/lnk.df:80
msgctxt "deathforth/events/sc/lnk.df"
msgid "KYAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAA!!!!!!!"
msgstr "키야아아아아아아아아아아아아아아아아아아아아!!!!!!!"

#: deathforth/events/sc/lnk.df:80
msgctxt "deathforth/events/sc/lnk.df"
msgid ""
"\r\n"
"\tHe ends up cutting everything near him, and also cuts himself up pretty bad."
msgstr ""
"\r\n"
"\t결국 주변의 모든 걸 베어 버리고, 자기도 꽤 심하게 베인다."

#: deathforth/events/sc/madsci.df:9
msgctxt "deathforth/events/sc/madsci.df"
msgid "Looks like the "
msgstr "<EMPTY>"

#: deathforth/events/sc/madsci.df:9
msgctxt "deathforth/events/sc/madsci.df"
msgid "mad scientist"
msgstr "미친 과학자"

#: deathforth/events/sc/madsci.df:9
msgctxt "deathforth/events/sc/madsci.df"
msgid " will never get to her destination, now."
msgstr "은(는) 이제 목적지에 영영 못 갈 것 같다."

#: deathforth/events/sc/madsci.df:11
msgctxt "deathforth/events/sc/madsci.df"
msgid "Back to the Lab"
msgstr "연구소로 돌아가기"

#: deathforth/events/sc/madsci.df:13 deathforth/events/sc/madsci.df:17
msgctxt "deathforth/events/sc/madsci.df"
msgid "The scientist"
msgstr "과학자"

#: deathforth/events/sc/madsci.df:13
msgctxt "deathforth/events/sc/madsci.df"
msgid ""
" gets to her lab alone.\r\n"
"\t\tShe wasn't part of the Canada plan, so looks like the journey is at an end."
msgstr ""
"은(는) 혼자 연구소에 도착한다.\r\n"
"\t\t그녀는 캐나다 계획에 포함되지 않았으니, 여정은 여기서 끝난 것 같다."

#: deathforth/events/sc/madsci.df:17
msgctxt "deathforth/events/sc/madsci.df"
msgid ""
" is delivered to her laboratory!\r\n"
"\t\tShe thanks "
msgstr ""
"은(는) 연구소에 무사히 도착했다!\r\n"
"\t\t그녀가 고마워하는 상대는 "

#: deathforth/events/sc/madsci.df:18
msgctxt "deathforth/events/sc/madsci.df"
msgid " and gives an "
msgstr ". 그리고 상으로 이걸 준다: "

#: deathforth/events/sc/madsci.df:18
msgctxt "deathforth/events/sc/madsci.df"
msgid "overcharged teleporter"
msgstr "과충전 텔레포터"

#: deathforth/events/sc/madsci.df:18
msgctxt "deathforth/events/sc/madsci.df"
msgid " as a reward!"
msgstr "!"

#: deathforth/events/sc/madsci.df:19
msgctxt "deathforth/events/sc/madsci.df"
msgid "NICE"
msgstr "좋아"

#: deathforth/events/sc/madsci.df:23
msgctxt "deathforth/events/sc/madsci.df"
msgid "If I knew you were going to be "
msgstr "네가 이 일로 이렇게 "

#: deathforth/events/sc/madsci.df:23
msgctxt "deathforth/events/sc/madsci.df"
msgid "weiner"
msgstr "찌질하게"

#: deathforth/events/sc/madsci.df:23
msgctxt "deathforth/events/sc/madsci.df"
msgid " about all this I never would have accepted the ride!"
msgstr " 굴 줄 알았으면 절대 안 태워 달라고 했을 거야!"

#: deathforth/events/sc/madsci.df:28
msgctxt "deathforth/events/sc/madsci.df"
msgid "Look on the bright side"
msgstr "긍정적으로 생각해"

#: deathforth/events/sc/madsci.df:29
msgctxt "deathforth/events/sc/madsci.df"
msgid ""
" wonders how this got so bad THIS fast.\r\n"
"\t\t"
msgstr ""
"은(는) 어떻게 이렇게 빨리 이렇게 망가졌는지 의아해한다.\r\n"
"\t\t"

#: deathforth/events/sc/madsci.df:30
msgctxt "deathforth/events/sc/madsci.df"
msgid ""
"I just accepted the ride and everyone's dead!\r\n"
"\t\tWell, at least I have this sweet car now."
msgstr ""
"태워 달라고 했을 뿐인데 다 죽었어!\r\n"
"\t\t뭐, 적어도 이제 이 멋진 차는 내 거네."

#: deathforth/events/sc/madsci.df:34
msgctxt "deathforth/events/sc/madsci.df"
msgid "Scientific Analysis"
msgstr "과학적 분석"

#: deathforth/events/sc/madsci.df:36
msgctxt "deathforth/events/sc/madsci.df"
msgid " lashes out at "
msgstr "은(는) 화를 퍼붓는다. 대상은 "

#: deathforth/events/sc/madsci.df:37
msgctxt "deathforth/events/sc/madsci.df"
msgid ""
"\r\n"
"\tIn my professional opinion you're "
msgstr ""
"\r\n"
"\t내 전문가적 소견으로 너희는 "

#: deathforth/events/sc/madsci.df:38
msgctxt "deathforth/events/sc/madsci.df"
msgid "butt"
msgstr "엉덩이"

#: deathforth/events/sc/mason.df:9
msgctxt "deathforth/events/sc/mason.df"
msgid " must have wandered off."
msgstr "는 어딘가로 떠돌아간 게 틀림없다."

#: deathforth/events/sc/mason.df:10
msgctxt "deathforth/events/sc/mason.df"
msgid " vanished off the face of the earth."
msgstr "는 지구상에서 사라져 버렸다."

#: deathforth/events/sc/mason.df:11
msgctxt "deathforth/events/sc/mason.df"
msgid " probably is fine."
msgstr "는 아마 괜찮을 거다."

#: deathforth/events/sc/mason.df:12
msgctxt "deathforth/events/sc/mason.df"
msgid " most likely gave up."
msgstr "는 아마 포기했을 거다."

#: deathforth/events/sc/mason.df:13
msgctxt "deathforth/events/sc/mason.df"
msgid "'ll probably turn up."
msgstr "는 아마 나타날 거다."

#: deathforth/events/sc/mason.df:17
msgctxt "deathforth/events/sc/mason.df"
msgid ""
"Too sad to continue, he wanders off to the nearest abandoned summer park and"
" sulks for years until more people show up."
msgstr "슬퍼서 더는 못 가겠다. 그는 가장 가까운 버려진 여름 공원으로 가서, 사람들이 더 올 때까지 몇 년이고 토라져 있는다."

#: deathforth/events/sc/mason.df:22
msgctxt "deathforth/events/sc/mason.df"
msgid "Also, "
msgstr "게다가, "

#: deathforth/events/sc/mason.df:22
msgctxt "deathforth/events/sc/mason.df"
msgid " is missing. "
msgstr "이(가) 사라졌다. "

#: deathforth/events/sc/mason.df:23
msgctxt "deathforth/events/sc/mason.df"
msgid " has left the team!"
msgstr "이(가) 일행을 떠났다!"

#: deathforth/events/sc/mason.df:30
msgctxt "deathforth/events/sc/mason.df"
msgid ""
"Your friend is back, alive and well! You thought he was a goner, but no, "
"he's right there in the car! You're so lucky!"
msgstr "친구가 돌아왔다, 멀쩡하게 살아서! 끝장난 줄 알았는데, 아니, 바로 차 안에 있다! 운이 정말 좋다!"

#: deathforth/events/sc/mason.df:32
msgctxt "deathforth/events/sc/mason.df"
msgid "Also, looks like "
msgstr "게다가, "

#: deathforth/events/sc/mason.df:32
msgctxt "deathforth/events/sc/mason.df"
msgid " is gone from the team. "
msgstr "이(가) 일행에서 사라진 것 같다. "

#: deathforth/events/sc/mason.df:40
msgctxt "deathforth/events/sc/mason.df"
msgid "Memories of Camp Bloodkill"
msgstr "블러드킬 캠프의 추억"

#: deathforth/events/sc/mason.df:41
msgctxt "deathforth/events/sc/mason.df"
msgid "While camping for the night, "
msgstr "밤에 야영하던 중, "

#: deathforth/events/sc/mason.df:41
msgctxt "deathforth/events/sc/mason.df"
msgid " has a lot of fond memories about his last time at summer camp!"
msgstr "은(는) 지난번 여름 캠프의 즐거운 추억을 잔뜩 떠올린다!"

#: deathforth/events/sc/mason.df:46
msgctxt "deathforth/events/sc/mason.df"
msgid " was going to get up to some "
msgstr "은(는) 이런 걸 벌이려고 했다: "

#: deathforth/events/sc/mason.df:46
msgctxt "deathforth/events/sc/mason.df"
msgid "WACKY ANTICS"
msgstr "엉뚱한 짓"

#: deathforth/events/sc/mason.df:46
msgctxt "deathforth/events/sc/mason.df"
msgid " but it looks like he was the one to disappear, for a change."
msgstr ". 그런데 이번엔 자기가 사라진 것 같다."

#: deathforth/events/sc/mason.df:48
msgctxt "deathforth/events/sc/mason.df"
msgid "The Ultimate Genki"
msgstr "궁극의 겐키"

#: deathforth/events/sc/mason.df:49
msgctxt "deathforth/events/sc/mason.df"
msgid ""
" feels all alone in the world.\r\n"
"\t\tBut he can't let it get him down! If he keeps on going, he knows that he'll meet new friends!"
msgstr ""
"은(는) 세상에 혼자 남은 기분이다.\r\n"
"\t\t하지만 기죽을 순 없다! 계속 가다 보면 새 친구를 만날 거라는 걸 안다!"

#: deathforth/events/sc/mason.df:54
msgctxt "deathforth/events/sc/mason.df"
msgid "At least someone has a positive outlook"
msgstr "적어도 누군가는 긍정적이다"

#: deathforth/events/sc/mason.df:55
msgctxt "deathforth/events/sc/mason.df"
msgid " suddenly seems to get a big boost in morale!"
msgstr "은(는) 갑자기 사기가 크게 오른 것 같다!"

#: deathforth/events/sc/mason.df:65
msgctxt "deathforth/events/sc/mason.df"
msgid "Return to Camp Bloodkill 2: The Return"
msgstr "블러드킬 캠프로의 귀환 2: 귀환"

#: deathforth/events/sc/mason.df:66
msgctxt "deathforth/events/sc/mason.df"
msgid " feels really lonely without his friends."
msgstr "은(는) 친구들이 없어서 무척 외롭다."

#: deathforth/events/sc/mason.df:69
msgctxt "deathforth/events/sc/mason.df"
msgid "He's just really optimistic"
msgstr "그냥 엄청 낙천적인 거다"

#: deathforth/events/sc/mason.df:70
msgctxt "deathforth/events/sc/mason.df"
msgid " is feeling really down in the dumps but then suddenly feels better!"
msgstr "은(는) 우울해하다가 갑자기 기분이 좋아진다!"

#: deathforth/events/sc/ninja.df:17 deathforth/events/sc/ninja.df:20
#: deathforth/events/sc/ninja.df:24
msgctxt "deathforth/events/sc/ninja.df"
msgid "The ninja"
msgstr "닌자"

#: deathforth/events/sc/ninja.df:17
msgctxt "deathforth/events/sc/ninja.df"
msgid ""
" was planning to leave the group now, but it looks like she left just a "
"little early."
msgstr "은(는) 이제 일행을 떠날 계획이었지만, 조금 일찍 떠나 버린 것 같다."

#: deathforth/events/sc/ninja.df:18
msgctxt "deathforth/events/sc/ninja.df"
msgid "Ninja Vanish!"
msgstr "닌자 퇴장!"

#: deathforth/events/sc/ninja.df:20
msgctxt "deathforth/events/sc/ninja.df"
msgid ""
" was about to slam down a smoke bomb and disappear mysteriously, but there's no one around to witness it. What's the fun in that?\r\n"
"\t\tShe decides to stick around for a bit longer."
msgstr ""
"은(는) 연막탄을 내리꽂고 신비롭게 사라지려 했지만, 지켜볼 사람이 아무도 없다. 그게 무슨 재미야?\r\n"
"\t\t그녀는 좀 더 있어 보기로 한다."

#: deathforth/events/sc/ninja.df:24
msgctxt "deathforth/events/sc/ninja.df"
msgid ""
" strikes a dramatic crossed-arms pose. Her headband flutters in the wind.\r\n"
"\t"
msgstr ""
"은(는) 팔짱을 끼고 극적인 포즈를 잡는다. 머리띠가 바람에 휘날린다.\r\n"
"\t"

#: deathforth/events/sc/ninja.df:25
msgctxt "deathforth/events/sc/ninja.df"
msgid "Looks like... my work is done."
msgstr "보아하니... 내 일은 끝났군."

#: deathforth/events/sc/ninja.df:25
msgctxt "deathforth/events/sc/ninja.df"
msgid ""
"\r\n"
"\t\tShe slams a smoke bomb into the ground and disappears, leaving behind a small satchel.\r\n"
"\t\tThe satchel is full of smoke bombs!\r\n"
"\t\t"
msgstr ""
"\r\n"
"\t\t그녀가 연막탄을 내리꽂고 사라진다. 뒤에 작은 주머니 하나가 남는다.\r\n"
"\t\t주머니엔 연막탄이 가득하다!\r\n"
"\t\t"

#: deathforth/events/sc/ninja.df:28
msgctxt "deathforth/events/sc/ninja.df"
msgid "GOT 7 SMOKE BOMBS!"
msgstr "연막탄 7개 획득!"

#: deathforth/events/sc/ninja.df:34
msgctxt "deathforth/events/sc/ninja.df"
msgid "Ninja Tantrum!"
msgstr "닌자 떼쓰기!"

#: deathforth/events/sc/ninja.df:35
msgctxt "deathforth/events/sc/ninja.df"
msgid ""
" kicks her door open.\r\n"
"\t"
msgstr ""
"은(는) 차 문을 발로 차서 연다.\r\n"
"\t"

#: deathforth/events/sc/ninja.df:36
msgctxt "deathforth/events/sc/ninja.df"
msgid "Screw this!"
msgstr "다 집어치워!"

#: deathforth/events/sc/ninja.df:36
msgctxt "deathforth/events/sc/ninja.df"
msgid ""
"\r\n"
"\tShe tumbles out of the car, does a backflip, lands into a crouch, stands up, then throws a smoke bomb and vanishes."
msgstr ""
"\r\n"
"\t그녀는 차에서 굴러 나와 백플립을 하고, 웅크린 자세로 착지하고, 일어서서, 연막탄을 던지고 사라진다."

#: deathforth/events/sc/ninja.df:40
msgctxt "deathforth/events/sc/ninja.df"
msgid "The car drives on for a bit but eventually comes to a stop."
msgstr "차가 잠시 더 달리다 결국 멈춘다."

#: deathforth/events/sc/ninja.df:42
msgctxt "deathforth/events/sc/ninja.df"
msgid " is both startled and impressed by this."
msgstr "은(는) 깜짝 놀라면서도 감탄한다."

#: deathforth/events/sc/omentum.df:5
msgctxt "deathforth/events/sc/omentum.df"
msgid "Where am I?"
msgstr "여기가 어디지?"

#: deathforth/events/sc/omentum.df:6
msgctxt "deathforth/events/sc/omentum.df"
msgid " loses a complete sense of direction, having no idea where "
msgstr "은(는) 방향 감각을 완전히 잃었다. 지금 "

#: deathforth/events/sc/omentum.df:6
msgctxt "deathforth/events/sc/omentum.df"
msgid " is."
msgstr "가 어디 있는지 전혀 모른다."

#: deathforth/events/sc/omentum.df:8
msgctxt "deathforth/events/sc/omentum.df"
msgid ""
" wanders off into uncharted territory on her maps, not even bothering to "
"mark it. "
msgstr "는 지도에도 없는 땅으로 떠돌아가며, 표시할 생각조차 안 한다. "

#: deathforth/events/sc/omentum.df:8
msgctxt "deathforth/events/sc/omentum.df"
msgid " was never seen again."
msgstr "는 다시는 보이지 않았다."

#: deathforth/events/sc/omentum.df:11
msgctxt "deathforth/events/sc/omentum.df"
msgid "You don't deserve this, I'm taking it back!"
msgstr "넌 이걸 가질 자격이 없어, 도로 가져갈 거야!"

#: deathforth/events/sc/omentum.df:12
msgctxt "deathforth/events/sc/omentum.df"
msgid " angrily swipes the map "
msgstr "는 화가 나서 지도를 도로 낚아챈다. "

#: deathforth/events/sc/omentum.df:12
msgctxt "deathforth/events/sc/omentum.df"
msgid " bought from "
msgstr "이(가) 산 지도다. 판 사람은 "

#: deathforth/events/sc/omentum.df:12
msgctxt "deathforth/events/sc/omentum.df"
msgid " and stomps off!"
msgstr ". 그러고는 쿵쿵대며 떠난다!"

#: deathforth/events/sc/omentum.df:15
msgctxt "deathforth/events/sc/omentum.df"
msgid " tells "
msgstr "는 "

#: deathforth/events/sc/omentum.df:15
msgctxt "deathforth/events/sc/omentum.df"
msgid ""
" that she is charting another map, and wanders off into a random direction.\r\n"
"\t\t\tAfter many hours, it's clear "
msgstr ""
"에게 다른 지도를 그리러 간다고 말하고 아무 방향으로나 떠나 버린다.\r\n"
"\t\t\t몇 시간이 지나자 분명해진다. "

#: deathforth/events/sc/omentum.df:16
msgctxt "deathforth/events/sc/omentum.df"
msgid " has no intention of coming back."
msgstr "는 돌아올 생각이 전혀 없다."

#: deathforth/events/sc/omentum.df:19 deathforth/events/sc/omentum.df:70
#: deathforth/events/sc/omentum.df:83 deathforth/events/sc/omentum.df:96
msgctxt "deathforth/events/sc/omentum.df"
msgid " has left the team."
msgstr "이(가) 일행을 떠났다."

#: deathforth/events/sc/omentum.df:26
msgctxt "deathforth/events/sc/omentum.df"
msgid "Pukeymon?"
msgstr "푸키몬?"

#: deathforth/events/sc/omentum.df:27
msgctxt "deathforth/events/sc/omentum.df"
msgid "Woah! "
msgstr "와! "

#: deathforth/events/sc/omentum.df:27
msgctxt "deathforth/events/sc/omentum.df"
msgid ""
" managed to survive. Nice!\r\n"
"\tIts owner may be dead, but it seems like it wants to stick around anyway.\r\n"
"\tWhat should "
msgstr ""
"이(가) 살아남았다. 좋아!\r\n"
"\t주인은 죽었을지 몰라도, 계속 함께 있고 싶은 것 같다.\r\n"
"\t어떻게 할까: "

#: deathforth/events/sc/omentum.df:29
msgctxt "deathforth/events/sc/omentum.df"
msgid " do?"
msgstr "?"

#: deathforth/events/sc/omentum.df:43
msgctxt "deathforth/events/sc/omentum.df"
msgid "Looks like "
msgstr "<EMPTY>"

#: deathforth/events/sc/omentum.df:43
msgctxt "deathforth/events/sc/omentum.df"
msgid " disappeared! How odd."
msgstr "이(가) 사라졌다! 이상하네."

#: deathforth/events/sc/omentum.df:44
msgctxt "deathforth/events/sc/omentum.df"
msgid "Huh? Something's happening..."
msgstr "어? 무슨 일이 일어나고 있다..."

#: deathforth/events/sc/omentum.df:45
msgctxt "deathforth/events/sc/omentum.df"
msgid "Congratulations! "
msgstr "축하합니다! "

#: deathforth/events/sc/omentum.df:45
msgctxt "deathforth/events/sc/omentum.df"
msgid "'s Pukeymon evolved! It looks stronger than before."
msgstr "의 푸키몬이 진화했다! 전보다 강해 보인다."

#: deathforth/events/sc/omentum.df:54
msgctxt "deathforth/events/sc/omentum.df"
msgid "It makes a low growl, ready to fight!"
msgstr "낮게 으르렁거린다. 싸울 준비가 됐다!"

#: deathforth/events/sc/omentum.df:58
msgctxt "deathforth/events/sc/omentum.df"
msgid ": Alright!"
msgstr ": 좋아!"

#: deathforth/events/sc/omentum.df:63
msgctxt "deathforth/events/sc/omentum.df"
msgid "Whiting Out"
msgstr "눈앞이 하얘졌다"

#: deathforth/events/sc/omentum.df:64
msgctxt "deathforth/events/sc/omentum.df"
msgid " doesn't seem satisfied with how "
msgstr "은(는) 영 마음에 들지 않는다. "

#: deathforth/events/sc/omentum.df:64
msgctxt "deathforth/events/sc/omentum.df"
msgid " training of "
msgstr " 훈련 방식도, "

#: deathforth/events/sc/omentum.df:64
msgctxt "deathforth/events/sc/omentum.df"
msgid " Pukeymon is going."
msgstr " 푸키몬의 성장도."

#: deathforth/events/sc/omentum.df:66
msgctxt "deathforth/events/sc/omentum.df"
msgid ""
" withdraws it back into its Pukeyball, and wanders off somewhere, never to "
"be seen again."
msgstr "는 푸키몬을 푸키볼로 돌려보내고 어딘가로 떠나 다시는 보이지 않는다."

#: deathforth/events/sc/omentum.df:68
msgctxt "deathforth/events/sc/omentum.df"
msgid ""
"I'm sorry guys, but my buddy and I need to part ways now. I'm sure we'll "
"meet again down the road!"
msgstr "미안해 얘들아, 나랑 내 친구는 이제 헤어져야 해. 길 어딘가에서 다시 만날 거야!"

#: deathforth/events/sc/omentum.df:75
msgctxt "deathforth/events/sc/omentum.df"
msgid "THAT'S ENOUGH"
msgstr "이제 그만"

#: deathforth/events/sc/omentum.df:76
msgctxt "deathforth/events/sc/omentum.df"
msgid " explodes in a fit of rage, unable to control "
msgstr "은(는) 분노가 폭발해서 통제하지 못한다: "

#: deathforth/events/sc/omentum.df:76
msgctxt "deathforth/events/sc/omentum.df"
msgid "self and see any reason."
msgstr " 자신을. 이성 따윈 없다."

#: deathforth/events/sc/omentum.df:78
msgctxt "deathforth/events/sc/omentum.df"
msgid " runs off guns blazing, attracting a horde, never to be seen again."
msgstr "는 총을 마구 쏘며 뛰쳐나가 좀비 떼를 끌어모으고, 다시는 보이지 않는다."

#: deathforth/events/sc/omentum.df:80
msgctxt "deathforth/events/sc/omentum.df"
msgid " swears profusely at "
msgstr "는 욕을 퍼붓는다. 대상은 "

#: deathforth/events/sc/omentum.df:80
msgctxt "deathforth/events/sc/omentum.df"
msgid ""
" before stomping off. This is a family friendly game, so we won't be writing"
" what "
msgstr ". 그러고는 쿵쿵대며 떠난다. 가족용 게임이라 적지 않겠다. 무슨 말을 했는지는... "

#: deathforth/events/sc/omentum.df:80
msgctxt "deathforth/events/sc/omentum.df"
msgid " said."
msgstr "만 알 거다."

#: deathforth/events/sc/omentum.df:88
msgctxt "deathforth/events/sc/omentum.df"
msgid "Not cool, man"
msgstr "그건 아니지, 친구"

#: deathforth/events/sc/omentum.df:89
msgctxt "deathforth/events/sc/omentum.df"
msgid " feels upset with "
msgstr "은(는) "

#: deathforth/events/sc/omentum.df:89
msgctxt "deathforth/events/sc/omentum.df"
msgid "self. Not to mention, "
msgstr " 자신에게 화가 난다. 게다가 "

#: deathforth/events/sc/omentum.df:89
msgctxt "deathforth/events/sc/omentum.df"
msgid " hasn't had a good bite to eat."
msgstr "는 제대로 된 끼니를 못 먹었다."

#: deathforth/events/sc/omentum.df:90
msgctxt "deathforth/events/sc/omentum.df"
msgid " decides the best course of action is to return to the house "
msgstr "는 최선책이 그 집으로 돌아가는 거라고 결정한다. "

#: deathforth/events/sc/omentum.df:90
msgctxt "deathforth/events/sc/omentum.df"
msgid " was standing in when "
msgstr "가 서 있던 그 집. "

#: deathforth/events/sc/omentum.df:90
msgctxt "deathforth/events/sc/omentum.df"
msgid " was recruited into the team."
msgstr "가 일행에 영입될 때 말이다."

#: deathforth/events/sc/omentum.df:92
msgctxt "deathforth/events/sc/omentum.df"
msgid " turns the car around and finds "
msgstr "는 차를 돌려 다시 찾는다: "

#: deathforth/events/sc/omentum.df:92
msgctxt "deathforth/events/sc/omentum.df"
msgid " home once again!"
msgstr " 집을!"

#: deathforth/events/sc/omentum.df:94
msgctxt "deathforth/events/sc/omentum.df"
msgid " starts walking back until "
msgstr "는 걸어서 돌아가기 시작한다. 결국 "

#: deathforth/events/sc/omentum.df:94
msgctxt "deathforth/events/sc/omentum.df"
msgid " see "
msgstr "의 눈앞에서 "

#: deathforth/events/sc/omentum.df:94
msgctxt "deathforth/events/sc/omentum.df"
msgid " disappear into the horizon."
msgstr "는 지평선 너머로 사라진다."

#: deathforth/events/sc/santa.df:11
msgctxt "deathforth/events/sc/santa.df"
msgid "CHRISTMAS IS OVER FOREVER"
msgstr "크리스마스는 영원히 끝났다"

#: deathforth/events/sc/santa.df:12
msgctxt "deathforth/events/sc/santa.df"
msgid ", alone and defeated, stops at an empty house. "
msgstr "은(는) 홀로 패배한 채 빈집에 멈춘다. "

#: deathforth/events/sc/santa.df:12
msgctxt "deathforth/events/sc/santa.df"
msgid " goes up the chimney, and is never seen again."
msgstr "는 굴뚝으로 올라가 다시는 보이지 않는다."

#: deathforth/events/sc/santa.df:16
msgctxt "deathforth/events/sc/santa.df"
msgid "THAT ONE TIM ALLEN MOVIE BASICALLY"
msgstr "그 팀 앨런 영화랑 사실상 똑같음"

#: deathforth/events/sc/santa.df:17
msgctxt "deathforth/events/sc/santa.df"
msgid " lies down on the road in a state of despair. In a freak accident, "
msgstr "은(는) 절망에 빠져 도로에 눕는다. 기막힌 사고로, "

#: deathforth/events/sc/santa.df:17
msgctxt "deathforth/events/sc/santa.df"
msgid " runs "
msgstr "이(가) "

#: deathforth/events/sc/santa.df:17
msgctxt "deathforth/events/sc/santa.df"
msgid ""
" over with the car. \r\n"
"\tDue to the CURSE OF SAINT NICK, "
msgstr ""
"를 차로 친다. \r\n"
"\t성 니콜라스의 저주 때문에, "

#: deathforth/events/sc/santa.df:18
msgctxt "deathforth/events/sc/santa.df"
msgid " is instantly turned into the new Santa."
msgstr "은(는) 순식간에 새 산타가 된다."

#: deathforth/events/sc/santa.df:24
msgctxt "deathforth/events/sc/santa.df"
msgid "The Night Before Christmas"
msgstr "크리스마스 전날 밤"

#: deathforth/events/sc/santa.df:25
msgctxt "deathforth/events/sc/santa.df"
msgid " wakes up after a night of camping to find an extra Santa. "
msgstr "은(는) 야영 후 일어나 보니 산타가 하나 더 있다. "

#: deathforth/events/sc/santa.df:25
msgctxt "deathforth/events/sc/santa.df"
msgid ""
" decides to say nothing about this, and to pretend that nothing is wrong."
msgstr "는 아무 말도 안 하고 아무 문제 없는 척하기로 한다."
